Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Owner''s equity is the portion of assets financed by bank loans and trade creditors.', 'Total equity grew by more than 22.8% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'Trade payables grew by more than 10.4% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'Total assets grew by more than 10.2% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'Non-current liabilities amount to more than 78.1% of total equity in Year 1.'], ARRAY[false, false, true, false, true], ARRAY['FALSE — The balance sheet identity is Assets = Liabilities + Equity.

