$$

$$
EPS = \frac{230}{420} = €0.5476
$$

Threshold: exceeds €0.39. Actual ≈ €0.55.

Reading the arithmetic against the claim: EPS €0.55 exceeds €0.39 so the statement holds.

The statement is true.'], '4/5', 127, 'full' ),
