\text{Revenue}_{\text{Y2}} = 1,281
$$

$$
\frac{1,281 - 1,055}{1,055} = 21.4\%
$$

$$
21.4\% > 19.8\%
$$

The actual growth is 21.4%, which is more than the claimed 19.8%.

