$$

$$
Coverage = 15.5455
$$

Threshold: more than 9.14. Actual 15.55.

Reading the arithmetic against the claim: coverage 15.55 exceeds 9.14 so the statement holds.

The statement is true.'], '4/5', 2, 'full' ),
