\text{Asset A – Machinery}: \frac{174,000 - 0}{11} = 15,818
$$

$$
\text{Asset B – Delivery truck}: \frac{46,000 - 7,000}{6} = 6,500
$$

$$
\text{Asset C – Computer equipment}: \frac{19,000 - 0}{3} = 6,333
$$

$$
\text{Combined} = 28,652
$$

