Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Cost of sales includes administration costs, shipping to customers and sales-staff costs.', 'The gross profit margin, gross profit taken as a share of revenue, is more than 3.4 percentage points higher in Year 2 than in Year 1.', 'The operating result grew by more than 22.7% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'Revenue grew by more than 19.9% between Year 1 and Year 2.', 'The operating result covers finance costs more than 11.31 times over in Year 1.'], ARRAY[false, false, false, false, true], ARRAY['FALSE — The income statement reports period performance (revenue, costs, profit).

