Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Under the straight-line method, the depreciable cost is spread evenly over the expected useful life, giving the same depreciation charge each year.', 'Working capital of €64 thousand is positive on this balance sheet.', 'The equity ratio is below 35.2%.', 'The current ratio is below 1.04.', 'The debt ratio exceeds 45.4%.'], ARRAY[true, true, true, false, true], ARRAY['TRUE — The income statement reports period performance (revenue, costs, profit).

