Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['For this printing company, the dividends paid line of (20100) euros belongs in investing activities.', 'For this printing company, dividends paid to shareholders sit in financing activities, not operating activities.', 'For this printing company, the investing outflow of 68,400 euros means the business must be failing.', 'For this printing company, an investing outflow and a dividend payment can appear in the same year because investing and financing are separate sections.', 'For this printing company, repayments of borrowed money count as operating cash outflows.'], ARRAY[false, true, false, true, false], ARRAY['FALSE — The income statement reports period performance (revenue, costs, profit).

