$$
ER = \frac{543}{1,149}
$$

$$
ER = 47.3\%
$$

Claimed: exceeds 47.3%. Actual 47.3%.

Reading the arithmetic against the claim: actual equity ratio 47.3% does not match ''exceeds 47.3%'' so the statement does not hold.

