( '6.5', 'CASE 6.5.006', 'Liquidity From the Balance Sheet 6', 'Consider the following balance sheet (in € thousands) for a business whose identity is not disclosed.

[[CHART type="pie" title="Asset composition"]]
Buildings=489
Machinery=232
