$$

$$
Share = 45.1\%
$$

Threshold: more than 55.6%. Actual 45.1%.

Reading the arithmetic against the claim: actual share 45.1% does not match ''more than 55.6%'' so the statement does not hold.

The statement is false.'], '4/5', 41, 'full' ),
