Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Market capitalisation at the last month exceeds €20.2 million.', 'The closing share price rose by more than 28.9% from first to last month.', 'Highest closing price is more than 39.8% above the lowest.', 'Market capitalisation rose by more than 14.1% over the period.', 'Total shares traded over six months exceed 9.1% of shares outstanding.'], ARRAY[true, false, false, true, true], ARRAY['TRUE — Market capitalisation values the equity at the latest closing price times shares outstanding.

Name the identity in words: market capitalisation = last closing price × shares outstanding.

$$
