$$

$$
\text{MCap} = 25 \times 882,000 = €22.05\text{ million}
$$

Threshold: exceeds €20.2 million. Actual €22.05 million.

Reading the arithmetic against the claim: market cap €22.05m exceeds €20.2m so the statement holds.

